      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1476 - Abu Basir narrated from Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) who said:\n\"If you intend to travel on the day of Eid and dawn breaks while you are still in the town, then do not leave until you have witnessed that Eid”."
        ]
